.TH ORO-DIAGNOSTICS-RUNTIME 3 "" "Oro Runtime" "Oro Runtime API Manual"
.SH NAME
oro:diagnostics/runtime \- JavaScript API module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
import * as module from 'oro:diagnostics/runtime'
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
oro:diagnostics/runtime is a JavaScript API module exposed by the Oro Runtime.
.SH REFERENCE
.TP
\fBgetCapabilities()\fR
Reports implemented Android native contracts and explicit unavailable features. A supported contract still needs permission, active ownership, and application authorization. Other platforms reject with ENOSYS.
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIPromise<RuntimeCapabilities>\fR
.TP
\fBgetBuildIdentity()\fR
Reads Android build identity without URLs, account data, input values, or logs. Other platforms reject with `ENOSYS`. This is not proof of release signing.
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIPromise<AndroidBuildIdentity>\fR
.TP
\fBDiagnostic\fR
A base container class for diagnostic information.
.TP
\fBUVDiagnostic (extends Diagnostic)\fR
A container for libuv diagnostics
.TP
\fBPostsDiagnostic (extends Diagnostic)\fR
A container for Core Post diagnostics.
.TP
\fBChildProcessDiagnostic (extends Diagnostic)\fR
A container for child process diagnostics.
.TP
\fBAIDiagnostic (extends Diagnostic)\fR
A container for AI diagnostics.
.TP
\fBFSDiagnostic (extends Diagnostic)\fR
A container for various filesystem diagnostics.
.TP
\fBTimersDiagnostic (extends Diagnostic)\fR
A container for various timers diagnostics.
.TP
\fBUDPDiagnostic (extends Diagnostic)\fR
A container for UDP diagnostics.
.TP
\fBQueryDiagnostic\fR
A container for various queried runtime diagnostics.
.TP
\fBquery(type)\fR
Queries runtime diagnostics.
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIPromise<QueryDiagnostic>\fR
